    "issue_key": "MER-124",
    "summary": "Feature flag flickers during authenticated hydration",
    "description": "Signed-in users briefly see a feature-enabled screen that disappears after the server-provided tenant policy loads.\n\nTribal constraint: Authenticated rendering must use window.__MERIDIAN__ from the server; localStorage is only a logged-out fallback and reading it during render violates hydration parity.",
